  "description": "Stunning 1 bedroom apartment available to rent in Dublin city center, Erne Street Upper. \n\nSituated within a 2 minute walk of Grand Canal Dock and its vast array high tech industry such as Google, Facebook and Twitter, O'Callaghan Court is the perfect location in the heart of Dublin City. O'Callaghan Court is within a stones throw of Merrion Square and right in the centre of all that Dublin City has to offer.\n\nThese stunning apartments come fully furnished with custom-designed interiors of the highest quality. Residents have full 24 hour access to a private gym fully equipped with the latest in fitness technology. \n\nO'Callaghan Court Apartment Features - High-quality interior design finish with bespoke Italian furnishings throughout - Contemporary, fully-fitted kitchens and integrated high-spec appliances - Bathroom with heated towel rails, power shower and vanity unit - Tiled hallway floors - Fitted wardrobes with full-length mirror - 43\" 4k HD TV's as standard - Wired for SKY and Virgin Media TV and Internet - Complimentary 24hr access to private gym - Communal residents rooftop terrace.\n\nTo truly appreciate the uniqueness of this property, viewing is strongly advised. Please contact one of our team today to arrange a private viewing.\n\nFor more information please check out our new Website: www.so-living.ie",
